  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Izu Base - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "The Hiryu Custom sure left in a hurry.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Yeah. Another test voyage, of all things.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "It's strange that they loaded almost all of the@<Steel Dragons>' main force onto the Hiryu Custom@in a situation like this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "Maybe the test voyage is just a cover story,@and it's actually a top-secret operation...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Could be.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Then is the Hagane gonna be okay, left behind like that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "We Instructors will probably end up@filling the gap in their strength, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Everyone, listen up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Lieutenant Arieil Org belongs to the ATX Team, but she@stayed in Izu to deal with the Ares Geist,@which is believed to have descended to Earth.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "So until the Hiryu Custom returns, the Lieutenant@is temporarily assigned to the@<Special Tactics Instructor Unit>. Her call sign is Eleve 7.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "It's nice to meet you all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Likewise.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Also, the Special Tactics Instructor Unit has been@temporarily assigned to the Steel Dragons.@Our mothership will be the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "I knew it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "All personnel are to load their units onto the Hagane@by 1600, bring their personal belongings aboard@by 1800, and complete all the paperwork.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "1600, huh? That doesn't leave us much time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "We'd better get started right away.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Hey, what's gonna happen to me and Shoko?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Major Kai said he'd consult Dr. Kisaburo Azuma,@given what happened with the Crystal Dragoon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Then it looks like we'll be boarding the Hagane too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Any other questions?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Is the Soul Saber's evaluation test postponed?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "At least until the Hiryu Custom gets back,@I'd say so.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "(Akimi's gonna be bummed when he hears that...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "What?! Seriously?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Jinpu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Yeah. You kids go on home.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "H-Hold on a sec!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "No telling when this place'll be a battlefield again.@No, it might already be the front line.@Go home before you get badly hurt.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "But you're staying, aren't you, Jinpu?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Yeah, I've got other work to do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "What other work?! Come on, tell me!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "That's... something I can't tell you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "It's my dad, isn't it?! He told you to keep quiet?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "(That ain't exactly it... What a pickle.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "That's enough, Akimi.@Jinpu's right. Let's go home.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "And you're fine with that?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "It's not about being fine with it...@There's nothing we can do at this base right now.@Our job is done.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Wait, I...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "What the?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "An alarm?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Izu Base - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Was that...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Looks like the enemy's shown up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Dr. Wan, let's suspend@the investigation of Granteed for now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Eric",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Mm, okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "...If the gray <Thorn> is among the enemy,@I'm going out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "I can't authorize Bellzelute to sortie.@Nor Granteed, of course.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "You don't need to tell me.@I have no intention of getting in that thing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Unlike this boy, I have a reason to fight.@The gray Thorn killed my comrades.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Bellzelute is an important lead@in solving the mystery of Granteed.@We can't afford to lose it here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "I have no intention of getting shot down.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "That's not the point. I need you to hold back for now.@That's an order, Lieutenant Calvina.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Izu Base - Command Center",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "The objects that warped into Tokyo, Chiba and@Yokohama have been identified as <Zovorg>@mobile weapons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Sakae",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Attacking shopping districts instead of military bases...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Laker",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Steel Dragons' Ginto detachment, scramble for Tokyo.@Send the <AM> units from Hyakuri to Chiba@and from Yokota to Yokohama.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Roger. Sending the Ginto detachment to Tokyo,@Hyakuri to Chiba, and Yokota's AM units@to Yokohama on the double.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Jua-Mu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "...That's enough. Don't waste ammo.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Squire",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "(If not for Lord Al-Van's orders, I'd have wiped out@not just this district, but everyone living@in this city...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Lord Jua-Mu, an object resembling a battleship@is approaching fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Hmph. So they've come.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Sergeant Major Azuki, what's the status@of the civilian evacuation?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "According to the police, it's at about Level 7.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "The evacuation's further along than I expected.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "It's likely because the enemy hasn't attacked the city@much. And if that's to conserve ammunition,@then isn't the enemy's aim a diversion?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Good read, but we can't just overlook this situation.@Launch the mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Roger. Launching mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "There's a unit among them we've never seen before.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "It looks different from the Zovorg units@we've seen so far.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "That lone one... Is it the commander's unit?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Heh, the Steel Dragons' Hagane. The finest prey has@taken the bait. All units, proceed as planned.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Yes, ma'am!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units. Civilians are still evacuating.@Don't attack carelessly and make enemies explode.@Disable them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "But if that lets the enemy get away...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Then so be it. Until the civilians are evacuated,@keep damage to the city to a minimum. Understood?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Roger!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "All right... All units, spread out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "The enemy isn't moving... I knew it, this is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Yes, we've been lured out.@Eliminate the enemy units in this area@as quickly as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "(If the XO's hunch and mine are right,@their real target is probably...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Damn it, my Volrent pushed this far...!@If this weren't a diversion, you lot would never...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "But I've done what I came to do!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Hmph, don't get cocky. We only kept you@company this long on purpose.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Enemy units rapidly withdrawing from the area!@Heading north-northeast!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "That's toward Asakusa!@Like hell I'm lettin' 'em go, dang it!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Are you going after them, big brother?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "No, I can't allow you to act alone.@You're being targeted by the Dark Brain's remnants.@Act rashly, and the fighting could spread.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Ngh...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Status reports from Chiba and Yokohama...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Incoming message from Izu Base!@Gravity quake reading directly overhead!@Something seems to be warping in!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "...So my read was right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "A new Zovorg model... I'd like to capture it if we can.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "(So that's the commander unit. Take it down,@and it'll be a nice feather in my cap!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "(My body's in better shape than before I went to sleep...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "(Even though it's progressing to Stage 2, resting@my somatic nervous system with cold sleep@seems to have paid off.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "So their goal really is@to lure out forces like us...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "(Keep me company a while longer, Steel Dragons.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "You ain't goin' anywhere!@I'll tie you up and make you spill what you're plotting!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "(I've already done the job I was given,@but I'll take you on anyway!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}